    "intro_narrative": "You have breached the perimeter of the 'Silicon Sarcophagus,' a derelict data fortress abandoned by the mega-corporations after the Great Blackout. Your objective is to retrieve the legendary 'Omni-Key,' a universal decryption string capable of unlocking any vault in the net. The facility is silent, save for the hum of cooling fans and the flicker of dying neon strips. To synthesize the key, you must power up the dormant subsystems, route data through the chaotic network topology, and synchronize the ancient processors. The air smells of ozone and dust. Your deck is jacked in. Time to run.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
  },
